---
// 静态模式：使用查询参数 ?id=xxx
const basePath = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
        <script is:inline src={`${basePath}js/site-path.js`}></script>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>任务详情</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${basePath}favicon.svg`} />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={`${basePath}common.css`} />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 48px 16px;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(111, 134, 214, 0.25), transparent 45%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #eef2f7 0%, #f6f7fb 80%);
        color: #2f3b52;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .task-detail-page {
        width: min(960px, 100%);
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
        box-shadow:
          0 25px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.16),
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        overflow: auto;
      }

      .page-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 32px 36px 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fdfefe 0%, #edf1f9 100%);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e7f3;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .page-header h1 {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #1f2d3d;
      }

      .page-header p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #7d8ba5;
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }

      .page-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .back-btn {
        padding: 10px 22px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid #c9d2e3;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #4a5b75;
        font-size: 14px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .back-btn:hover {
        border-color: #9fb2cc;
        color: #1f2d3d;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(79, 133, 198, 0.18);
      }

      .page-body {
        padding: 30px 36px 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 22px;
        font-size: 15px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #fbfcff 100%);
      }

      .meta-info {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 12px 0 6px;
      }

      .badge {
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .badge.primary {
        background: rgba(86, 134, 255, 0.12);
        color: #3752c9;
        border: 1px solid rgba(86, 134, 255, 0.25);
      }

      .badge.ghost {
        background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.08);
        color: #1d68c2;
        border: 1px solid rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.15);
      }

      .badge.outline {
        border: 1px dashed #b1bfd8;
        color: #5c6b85;
      }

      .section-card {
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(226, 231, 241, 0.8);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(249, 251, 255, 0.9), rgba(241, 245, 255, 0.65));
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        padding: 20px 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .section-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: #1f2d3d;
      }

      .section-header h2 {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .section-header span {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #90a0bf;
      }

      .field-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .field-row.two-columns {
        flex-direction: row;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .field {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        color: #2f3b52;
        min-width: 280px;
      }

      .field .label {
        min-width: 130px;
        color: #5c6b85;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .field .required {
        color: #e53935;
        margin-right: 4px;
      }

      .field .value {
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .position-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .position-pill {
        padding: 4px 18px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid #57a5ff;
        color: #1f7ed0;
        background: #ecf5ff;
        font-size: 14px;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      }

      .star-levels {
        display: inline-flex;
        gap: 8px;
        color: #1f2d3d;
      }

      .pair {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
          font-size: 12px;
          color: #3a5471;
      }

      .info-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid #c0c6d4;
        color: #8492a6;
        font-size: 11px;
        cursor: help;
          flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .commission-grid {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .commission-card {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 220px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(183, 199, 236, 0.6);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(226, 239, 255, 0.8), rgba(247, 252, 255, 0.95));
        padding: 18px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .commission-card strong {
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #2e4cc5;
      }

      .project-commission {
        color: #d93026;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .star-commission {
        display: flex;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding-left: 4px;
        color: #5c6b85;
      }

      .star-commission span {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .star-commission strong {
        color: #1f2d3d;
        margin-left: 4px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        body {
          padding: 0;
        }

        .task-detail-page {
          border-radius: 0;
        }

        .page-header,
        .page-body {
          padding: 24px;
        }

        .meta-info {
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .field-row.two-columns {
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .star-commission {
          padding-left: 0;
        }

        .field .label {
          min-width: auto;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="task-detail-page">
      <header class="page-header">
        <div>
          <p id="task-id">任务编号：</p>
          <h1 id="task-detail-title">任务详情</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="page-actions">
          <button id="backButton" class="back-btn" type="button">返回上一页</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="page-body" aria-labelledby="task-detail-title">
        <div class="meta-info">
          <span class="badge primary" id="badge-type">任务类型：</span>
          <span class="badge ghost" id="badge-star-levels">可接星级：</span>
          <span class="badge outline" id="badge-duration">任务工期：</span>
        </div>

        <article class="section-card">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>基础信息</h2>
            <span>岗位与要求</span>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row two-columns">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label"><span class="required">*</span>任务类型：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-type"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">可接星级：</span>
              <span class="star-levels" id="field-star-levels"></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">可接单岗位：</span>
              <div class="position-tags" id="field-positions"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="section-card">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>佣金详情</h2>
            <span>基础金额与加价</span>
          </div>

          <div class="commission-grid">
            <div class="commission-card">
              <span>基础佣金(元)</span>
              <strong id="field-base-commission"></strong>
              <span class="project-commission" id="field-project-commission">项目佣金：</span>
            </div>
            <div class="commission-card">
              <span>加价佣金(元)</span>
              <strong id="field-markup-commission"></strong>
              <span class="pair" style="color: #5c6b85;">
                <span class="info-icon">?</span>
                此金额为三星岗位人员接单金额，二星人员接单金额为90%，一星为80%
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">各星级可得基础佣金：</span>
            </div>
            <div class="star-commission" id="field-star-commission"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="section-card">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>时间与备注</h2>
            <span>截止与补充说明</span>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row two-columns">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label"><span class="required">*</span>截止时间：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-deadline">未知</span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label"><span class="required">*</span>任务工期：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-duration">未知</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">任务备注：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-remark">无</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="section-card">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>执行信息</h2>
            <span>责任单位与范围</span>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row two-columns">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">执行单位：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-unit">无</span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">执行部门：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-department">无</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">任务范围：</span>
              <span class="value" id="field-scope">无</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script is:inline src={`${basePath}js/cookies.js`}></script>
    <script is:inline src={`${basePath}js/money.js`}></script>

    <script is:inline>
      // 从 URL 查询参数获取 id
      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      const taskId = urlParams.get("id");

      // 更新页面上的任务编号
      if (taskId) {
        const taskIdEl = document.getElementById('task-id');
        if (taskIdEl) taskIdEl.textContent = '任务编号：' + taskId;
      }

      const API_BASE_URL = "https://flexible.china9.cn/api";

      // 从 sessionStorage 加载数据
      function loadTaskDetailFromSessionStorage() {
        try {
          const taskInfoStr = sessionStorage.getItem("projectPerformanceDetailInfo");
          const projectInfoStr = sessionStorage.getItem("projectDetailInfo");

          if (taskInfoStr) {
            const taskInfo = JSON.parse(taskInfoStr);

            // 更新页面内容
            if (taskInfo.id) {
              const taskIdEl = document.getElementById('task-id');
              if (taskIdEl) taskIdEl.textContent = '任务编号：' + taskInfo.id;
            }

            if (taskInfo.hallTypeTitle) {
              const badgeTypeEl = document.getElementById('badge-type');
              if (badgeTypeEl) badgeTypeEl.textContent = '任务类型：' + taskInfo.hallTypeTitle;

              const fieldTypeEl = document.getElementById('field-type');
              if (fieldTypeEl) fieldTypeEl.textContent = taskInfo.hallTypeTitle;
            }

            const token = Cookies.get('employee_token');
            if (token) {
              fetch(`${API_BASE_URL}/Position/gradeList`, {
                  method: 'POST',
                  headers: {
                      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
                  },
                  body: JSON.stringify({
                    tokens: token,
                    enterpriseSide: 'pc'
                  }),
              })
                .then(res => res.json())
                .then(r => {
                  if (r.data && r.code === 1) {
                    const gradeList = Object.values(r.data);

                    if (gradeList && Array.isArray(gradeList)) {
                      const badgeStarEl = document.getElementById('badge-star-levels');
                      if (badgeStarEl) badgeStarEl.textContent = '可接星级：' + gradeList.join('、');

                      const fieldStarEl = document.getElementById('field-star-levels');
                      if (fieldStarEl) fieldStarEl.textContent = gradeList.join('、');
                    }
                  }
                })
                .catch(error => console.error('Failed to fetch project info:', error));
            }

            if (taskInfo.hall_duration) {
              const badgeDurationEl = document.getElementById('badge-duration');
              if (badgeDurationEl) badgeDurationEl.textContent = '任务工期：' + taskInfo.hall_duration + '个工作日';

              const fieldDurationEl = document.getElementById('field-duration');
              if (fieldDurationEl) fieldDurationEl.textContent = taskInfo.hall_duration + '个工作日';
            }

            const positionsContainer = document.getElementById('field-positions');
            if(taskInfo.hall_type){
              if (taskInfo.positionArray && Array.isArray(taskInfo.positionArray) && positionsContainer) {
                positionsContainer.innerHTML = taskInfo.positionArray
                  .map(pos => `<span class="position-pill">${pos.name}</span>`)
                  .join('');
              }
            } else if (positionsContainer) {
              positionsContainer.innerHTML = '无';
            }

            if (taskInfo.hall_user_money || taskInfo.bountymoney) {
              const baseCommEl = document.getElementById('field-base-commission');
              if (baseCommEl) baseCommEl.textContent = '￥' + (Number(taskInfo.hall_user_money) && Number(taskInfo.hall_money) ? (Number(taskInfo.hall_user_money) -
                Number(taskInfo.hall_money)).toLocaleString('zh-CN', {minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2}) : taskInfo.bountymoney);
            }

            if(projectInfoStr){
                const projectInfo = JSON.parse(projectInfoStr);
                let totalMoney = getTotalMoney(projectInfo);
              if (totalMoney) {
                const projCommEl = document.getElementById('field-project-commission');
                if (projCommEl) projCommEl.textContent = '项目佣金：￥' + totalMoney;
              }

              if (projectInfo.hall_money) {
                const markupEl = document.getElementById('field-markup-commission');
                if (markupEl) markupEl.textContent = '￥' + (projectInfo.hall_money || 0);
              }
            }

            if (taskInfo.bountymoney) {
              const starCommEl = document.getElementById('field-star-commission');
              const starCommission = taskInfo.starCommission || [
                {
                  level: '三星',
                  amount: taskInfo.bountymoney
                },
                {
                  level: '二星',
                  amount: (Number(taskInfo.bountymoney) * 0.9).toLocaleString('zh-CN', {minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2})
                },
                {
                  level: '一星',
                  amount: (Number(taskInfo.bountymoney) * 0.8).toLocaleString('zh-CN', {minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2})
                }
              ];
              if (starCommEl) {
                starCommEl.innerHTML = starCommission
                  .map(item => `<span>${item.level}：<strong>￥${item.amount}</strong></span>`)
                  .join('');
              }
            }

            if (taskInfo.enddatatime) {
              const deadlineEl = document.getElementById('field-deadline');
              if (deadlineEl) deadlineEl.textContent = taskInfo.enddatatime;
            }

            if (taskInfo.description) {
              const remarkEl = document.getElementById('field-remark');
              if (remarkEl) remarkEl.textContent = taskInfo.description;
            }

            if (taskInfo.taskrangeInfo) {
              const unitEl = document.getElementById('field-unit');
              if (unitEl) unitEl.textContent = taskInfo.taskrangeInfo || '无';
            }

            if (taskInfo.taskDepartmentTitle && taskInfo.taskDepartmentTitle.title) {
              const deptEl = document.getElementById('field-department');
              if (deptEl) deptEl.textContent = taskInfo.taskDepartmentTitle.title || '无';
            }

            if (taskInfo.taskuserlist) {
              const scopeEl = document.getElementById('field-scope');
              if (scopeEl) scopeEl.textContent = getUserList(taskInfo.taskuserlist);
            }
          }
        } catch (error) {
          console.error('Failed to load data from sessionStorage:', error);
        }
      }

      // 页面加载时执行
      loadTaskDetailFromSessionStorage();

      // 返回按钮
      const backBtn = document.getElementById('backButton');
      if (backBtn) {
        backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          if (history.length > 1) {
            history.back();
          } else {
            window.location.href = window.sitePath('/');
          }
        });
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
